# Hosts allowed to reach EVE's face server (HTTP and WebSocket), in addition
# to loopback. Copy this file to `config.allowed-hosts` and put your own
# hostname in it. The tailnet name belongs here when Tailscale Serve
# terminates TLS in front of her: https://<your-machine>.<your-tailnet>.ts.net
# is the phone's door. One hostname per line; "#" starts a comment.
#
# This file is the ONE place the door is widened, by a human, on purpose — a
# request can never edit it. An absent file means loopback only, which is the
# safe default and the documented posture. (See src/face/origin.ts.)

# eve.tail1234.ts.net
